units metal
atom_style atomic
read_data examples/gallery/structure.data
pair_style lj/cut 8.5
pair_coeff * * 0.0103 3.4
compute T all temp
fix bath all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
    fix_modify bath temp T
dump traj all custom 100 trajectory.lammpstrj id type x y z
    run 10000
undump traj
unfix bath
uncompute T
